      "id": "special_collection_allowance",
      "institute": "base_salary",
      "variant": "all",
      "discriminant": "applies_when.trigger = outside_input",
      "rule": "INDENNITÀ SPECIALE (tabella per-livello nel PDF: L1=126.55→131.55 EUR): corrisposta solo al personale addetto alla riscossione con responsabilità di bollette/fatture > EUR 4.648/giorno. Condizionale, non universale. Non modellata. Totale ilccnl.it lug 2026 = Paga Base conferma assenza di elementi obbligatori aggiuntivi.",
      "calculation": "ccnl/pulizia-artigianato-confartigianato:coverage.notes",
      "state": "absent",
      "remediation": "Model l'indennità speciale per livello as an allowance gated by a role (addetti alla riscossione) or record a limitation.",
      "origin": "seeded",
      "links": {
        "limitations": [
          "pulizia-artigianato-confartigianato/special_collection_allowance"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sunday_holiday_ccnl_clause",
      "institute": "sunday_holiday",
      "variant": "all",
      "discriminant": "applies_when.trigger = path",
      "rule": "L. 260/1949 art. 5 pays the workers with a fixed salary a further daily quota only for the civil holidays (25 April, 1 May, 2 June) falling on a Sunday; the other holidays of art. 2 (1 January, 6 January, Easter Monday, 15 August, 4 October, 1 November, 8 December, 25 and 26 December) give it only by CCNL clause, and the payment of 4 November is a CCNL institute. A run of a month with such a holiday on a Sunday, in a CCNL whose clause is not sourced (work_rules.sunday_holidays), pays the statutory holidays only; a public employment is paid none, its treatment not being sourced.",
